    <h2>Project Description</h2>
    <p>Arkala is a role-playing game empowered by AI, where generative agents breathe life into a dynamic world reminiscent of Westworld. Every NPC has their own memory, goals, and motivations, creating an ever-evolving narrative landscape where no two playthroughs are the same.</p>
    <p>Meaningful interactions lie at the heart of Arkala. Player choices ripple through the world, shaping relationships and unlocking dynamic narratives that respond to every decision made throughout the journey.</p>
    <p>By harnessing the power of large language models and generative agents, Arkala pushes the boundaries of traditional RPGs, offering an experience where the story is truly shaped by the player.</p>
